            "stars": "5",
            "title": "The Only Functional Trainer That Met Every Standard",
            "copy": "It is 100% sturdy, everything works absolutely perfect, can be adjusted for bodies, height and weight, and amazingly comes with everything for a price so much lower than others I found with the same equipment. French Fitness warranty is also amazing and so much better than any other company. I have done business with in the past or current.",
